title: An extension that asks the app to change a file outside the open folders is refused, by a full path or one going up with '..'
folders: rust-small
fixtures: plain
extensions: write-extension
expect-log: extension qa\.fake-write started
expect-log: refused a write of QA writes to .*plain.src.main\.rs: it is not a document open in the app
expect-log: refused a write of QA writes to .*rust-small.\.\..plain.src.main\.rs: it goes up with \.\.
forbid-log: wrote .*plain.src.main\.rs
expect-file: plain/src/main.rs :: \A(?![\s\S]*changed by an extension)

wait 3000
command qa.write.outside
wait 2000
mark refused
wait 600
quit
